  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Delivery and pick-up points:</strong> Vehicle transport by train typically requires your vehicle to be delivered to and picked up from specific train stations, which might not be convenient for all customers.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>While train transport offers a unique solution, it may not be the most practical option for everyone in Masaurhi.</p>

